{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は午前中すごく暑かったよ～！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10分くらい外を歩いたんだけど\n日焼け止めも塗らずに半袖を着ていたので\n焼けちゃったかな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週の日曜日から神宮ライブ\n3daysあるし、\nすごく焼けそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"焼けたくないけど、\nいい天気だといいなっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てるてるぼーずつくらなきゃねっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/23/6173874/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/23/6173874/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のブログの10年前の\nお手紙が入ってるの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/23/6173874/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日、BRODYさん発売されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビーチサンダル×北野日奈子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真をよくみてほしいんですが、\n上に飛んでるビーチサンダルは\n私がシャッターの直前に\n足からぽいっと上に投げた\n瞬間なんだよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/23/6173874/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/23/6173874/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑いすぎてぐしゃぐしゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/23/6173874/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Samurai ELOさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あした発売！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ先輩とまりかさんと\n井上さんとひなちまと\n伊織と一緒に\n撮って頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好みのメンズファッションや\n靴についてもはなしてます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"B.L.T.さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あした発売です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソログラビアです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20歳になってから初めての\nソログラビア撮影でした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしかったよー！はやくみてほしいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitan